# Facings in eighths: the spin carries the units round through the facing between two views (the heroes show it,
# drawn in eight; the creatures keep their four), a unit turning a quarter (the knight at 7,6, facing se, strikes
# north-east) shows the facing between on its way, and a shot at a target off the map's axes is drawn facing it (an
# archer at 5,7 shoots the creature at 7,5: east).
nosave
test 1
wait 70
shot f00-view0
turn 1
wait 3
shot f01-spin-quarter
wait 3
shot f02-spin-half
wait 3
shot f03-spin-three-quarters
wait 12
shot f04-view1
checklayer
test 1
wait 70
place 0 7 6 0
wait 4
act 0 0 0 4
wait 1
shot f05-turning
wait 5
shot f06-turned
wait 40
test 1
wait 70
gear 2 8 65
place 2 5 7 0
wait 4
act 2 0 0 4
wait 6
shot f07-aim-east
wait 40
checklayer
